			icon: "minecraft:oak_sapling"
			description: ["Marnie: \"Snow's still on the ridge and the square's still standing. Come on, I want you to see it in daylight.\"", "", "Sleep one night in your own bed, then walk the square with Marnie. She hands you a packet on the way.", "", "Year two opens on thirty bare tiles and Nella's cold frame. What grows when is in the &6Farm & Seasons&r chapter."]
