			title: "Catch Three Named Fish for the Inn Wall"
			subtitle: "Bluegill and perch by day, catfish after dark."
			icon: "aquaculture:oak_fish_mount"
			description: ["Nella: \"Bluegill and perch off the pier any time. Catfish is a night fish and he wants a worm on the hook.\"", "", "Catch a bluegill and a perch off the pier in daylight, then a &acatfish&r after dark on a worm. Hang three fish mounts on the inn wall.", "", "Fifty Scrip toward the winter debt. Rods, bait and the rest of the lake are in the &6Animals & Fishing&r chapter."]
