			subtitle: "Six of eight neighbours' stories closed."
			icon: "minecraft:emerald"
			description: ["Oda: \"I do not keep a book of who likes you. I keep a book of who you have finished a thing for. Six is the number.\"", "", "Nothing to do here. It ticks itself when the sixth neighbour's chain closes. Press &bT&r and type &b/valley check standing&r for her count.", "", "At six, Oda counts you a local and puts the Works Deed on her counter at 80 Scrip. She will not be talked into rounding up."]
