			title: "Buy the Works Deed at Oda's Counter"
			subtitle: "80 Scrip, and six of eight stories closed."
			icon: "valley:deed"
			description: ["Halden: \"Josie meant the Works to belong to whoever stayed. Nobody has argued about it in four years.\"", "", "Pay &a80 Valley Scrip&r at Oda's counter. The other half of the price is Standing: Trusted, six of the eight resident chains closed, and it opens itself the moment the sixth one does.", "", "The Deed is yours: QuarryPlus becomes craftable, the residents vote, and Bram signs as witness."]
			x: 10.0d
